sequenceDiagram
  title: Login with refresh token
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant W as Web app
  participant A as Auth API
  participant R as Redis
  participant D as Users DB
  U->>W: submit email + password
  W->>A: POST /login
  A->>D: find user by email
  D-->>A: user row
  A->>A: verify bcrypt hash
  A->>R: SET refresh:{id} EX 14d
  A-->>W: 200 access + refresh token
  W-->>U: redirect to /home
